{"id":"bc06597e7f76b381b9d032238545151cdf9014e5","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1238022","title":"你们说，用多了 AI，会不会得类似 2077 的赛博精神病","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"qdwang","excerpt":"问与答 - @qdwang - 如题，好像已经有一些相关的调查研究了。大家的感觉呢？","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>如题，好像已经有一些相关的调查研究了。</p>\n<p>大家的感觉呢？</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/赛博\"><li></li> 赛博</a><a href=\"/tag/精神病\"><li></li> 精神病</a></P><p><span>12 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-30 00:36:43 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18029784\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/19ce/f31a/305835_normal.png?m=1762498606\" alt=\"Need4more\" data-uid=\"305835\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Need4more\">Need4more</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-29 13:03:45 +08:00\">21h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>你是说 AI 被你当成了义体，改造了你的大脑吗？</p><p>底子稳的人不会疯，疯了的人本来就认知不稳</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18029787\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a799/b6e0/76175_normal.png?m=1486722009\" alt=\"wm5d8b\" data-uid=\"76175\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wm5d8b\">wm5d8b</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-29 13:05:38 +08:00\">21h 35m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>听豆包的吃毒蘑菇吗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18029792\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f802/115e/599601_normal.png?m=1751349369\" alt=\"qilme\" data-uid=\"599601\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qilme\">qilme</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-29 13:08:53 +08:00\">21h 32m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>目前叫脑腐，不知道会不会发展成精神病</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18029827\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e0c78417de59a55487a950a571990acd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"SiWXie\" data-uid=\"631751\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/SiWXie\">SiWXie</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-29 13:31:59 +08:00\">21h 9m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在很多人宁可相信 ai ，也不相信课本上的知识了，更不相信某专家的话了，更进一步的，连自己都不相信了，不知道是不是好事</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18029844\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a21821dddd947dc5b0525e01c1e1dbc8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"dvazqcce\" data-uid=\"277730\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dvazqcce\">dvazqcce</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-29 13:42:06 +08:00\">20h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不会，较真的话 赛博精神病是因为侵入式脑机把脑神经（人格，人性，属于人的部分）搞坏了，才会变成精神病。除非以后像马斯克那样的侵入式脑机大范围安装，不然只是文字对话不可能得赛博精神病的。能做到的话就不是 AI 了，那是克苏鲁了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18029845\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6159/9999/582231_normal.png?m=1754617848\" alt=\"Nasdaq\" data-uid=\"582231\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Nasdaq\">Nasdaq</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-29 13:43:37 +08:00\">20h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>OP 谈谈对宗教、信仰、科学、媒体宣传的看法？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18029858\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/602a/1e42/177637_normal.png?m=1785677912\" alt=\"xujinkai\" data-uid=\"177637\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xujinkai\">xujinkai</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-29 13:50:38 +08:00\">20h 50m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我用最直白最不绕弯子的方式告诉你，我觉得会🤣</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18030056\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a76d/a371/4062_normal.png?m=1761067005\" alt=\"XnEnokq9vkvVq4\" data-uid=\"4062\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/XnEnokq9vkvVq4\">XnEnokq9vkvVq4</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-29 16:06:18 +08:00\">18h 35m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>最像精神病的是吵着要 bring back gpt-4o 的那个群体比如 r/MyBoyfriendIsAI ，典型的 AI psychosis</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18030097\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/20d0/c7b7/83104_normal.png?m=1772012507\" alt=\"kooze\" data-uid=\"83104\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kooze\">kooze</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-29 16:35:40 +08:00\">18h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>反正自从用了大模型的语音输入+微信语音输入。同事都说我神神叨叨的自言自语。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18030156\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5c3b/d976/405428_normal.png?m=1768658555\" alt=\"zisen\" data-uid=\"405428\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zisen\">zisen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-29 17:24:56 +08:00\">17h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我觉得我现在打字有点 ai 味了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18030157\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/93e4815240f8fcfdd37c78cfc77ae4b5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"monkey110\" data-uid=\"384525\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/monkey110\">monkey110</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-29 17:26:02 +08:00\">17h 15m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感觉语言表述能力有所下降。用豆包语音输入问 AI ，它们都能自动纠错。所以有时候表述的不清楚也无所谓。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"如题，好像已经有一些相关的调查研究了。 大家的感觉呢？ AI 赛博 精神病12 replies • 2026-08-30 00:36:43 +08:00 1 Need4more 21h 37m ago 你是说 AI 被你当成了义体，改造了你的大脑吗？底子稳的人不会疯，疯了的人本来就认知不稳 2 wm5d8b 21h 35m ago via Android 听豆包的吃毒蘑菇吗 3 qilme 21h 32m ago via Android 目前叫脑腐，不知道会不会发展成精神病 4 SiWXie 21h 9m ago via iPhone 现在很多人宁可相信 ai ，也不相信课本上的知识了，更不相信某专家的话了，更进一步的，连自己都不相信了，不知道是不是好事 5 dvazqcce 20h 59m ago 不会，较真的话 赛博精神病是因为侵入式脑机把脑神经（人格，人性，属于人的部分）搞坏了，才会变成精神病。除非以后像马斯克那样的侵入式脑机大范围安装，不然只是文字对话不可能得赛博精神病的。能做到的话就不是 AI 了，那是克苏鲁了 6 Nasdaq 20h 57m ago OP 谈谈对宗教、信仰、科学、媒体宣传的看法？ 7 xujinkai 20h 50m ago via Android 我用最直白最不绕弯子的方式告诉你，我觉得会🤣 8 XnEnokq9vkvVq4 18h 35m ago 1 最像精神病的是吵着要 bring back gpt-4o 的那个群体比如 r/MyBoyfriendIsAI ，典型的 AI psychosis 9 kooze 18h 5m ago 反正自从用了大模型的语音输入+微信语音输入。同事都说我神神叨叨的自言自语。 10 zisen 17h 16m ago 我觉得我现在打字有点 ai 味了 11 monkey110 17h 15m ago via Android 感觉语言表述能力有所下降。用豆包语音输入问 AI ，它们都能自动纠错。所以有时候表述的不清楚也无所谓。","fetched_at":"2026-08-30T02:45:13.862Z","ok":true}